@startuml
title 3번 슬라이드. 세션 인증 결과를 downstream 헤더로 relay한다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #FDBA74
  FontColor #7C2D12
}

left to right direction

rectangle "GatewayBffSecurityConfig\npermitAll + custom filter chain" as SecurityConfig #DBEAFE
rectangle "GatewaySessionCookieAuthenticationWebFilter" as CookieAuth #DCFCE7
rectangle "GatewaySessionPrincipalResolver" as Resolver #FEF3C7
rectangle "SessionHeaderRelayGlobalFilter" as RelayFilter #FDE68A
rectangle "X-Gateway-Context\nX-User-Id\nX-User-Roles\nX-Session-Id" as Headers #F8FAFC
rectangle "Downstream Security Starter\nGatewaySecurityValidationFilter\nGatewayRequestVerifier" as DownstreamSecurity #F8FAFC

SecurityConfig --> CookieAuth
CookieAuth --> Resolver
Resolver --> RelayFilter
RelayFilter --> Headers
Headers --> DownstreamSecurity

note bottom of RelayFilter
Gateway는 세션 인증 결과를
downstream 서비스가 검증 가능한
내부 헤더로 바꿔 전달한다.
end note

note bottom of DownstreamSecurity
각 서비스가 인증을 다시 구현하지 않고,
공통 보안 모듈에서 헤더를 검증한다.
end note

@enduml
